		{
			"name": "Design Pattern Workflow",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Create Order (All Patterns)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"workflowOrderId\", jsonData.id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"customerName\": \"Demo User\",\n  \"totalAmount\": 750.00,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"CREDIT_CARD\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"orders"
							]
						},
						"description": "**Step 1**: Create an order\n\n**Patterns in Action:**\n1. **Command**: PlaceOrderCommand executes\n2. **Chain of Responsibility**: Validation chain runs (Inventory → Payment)\n3. **Strategy**: CreditCardPayment strategy is used\n4. **Observer**: Notifications are sent"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. View Created Order",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{workflowOrderId}}",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"orders",
								"{{workflowOrderId}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "**Step 2**: Retrieve the order details from H2 database"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Cancel Order (Command + Observer)",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{workflowOrderId}}",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"orders",
								"{{workflowOrderId}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "**Step 3**: Cancel the order\n\n**Patterns in Action:**\n1. **Command**: CancelOrderCommand executes\n2. **Observer**: Cancellation notifications are sent"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Undo Cancellation (Command Undo)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/undo",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"orders",
								"undo"
							]
						},
						"description": "**Step 4**: Undo the cancellation\n\n**Pattern in Action:**\n- **Command**: Demonstrates undo functionality"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. View All Orders",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
